From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: goat-maintainer <person-30@example.org>
Date: Fri, 16 May 2026 00:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] consent: forward identity traits.groups into JWT id_token

The upstream oryd/kratos-selfservice-ui-node consent handler (extractSession
in src/routes/consent.ts) hardcodes a small whitelist of identity traits to
forward into the OIDC JWT — email, username, website, name. The `groups`
trait (an array we use for RBAC on every site Hydra consumer: Grafana,
netbird-dashboard, future relying parties) is not in the list, so it never
reaches the JWT and downstream services fall back to "every authenticated
identity is admin" pragmas.

This patch adds three lines to extractSession that forward
identity.traits.groups verbatim into session.id_token.groups when present
and non-empty. Additive only — existing behavior is unchanged for
identities that don't carry a groups trait.

Tracked: docs/project/implementation-plan.md Block 82B-rbac. Resolves the
v1 pragma in nova-obs (literal-'Admin' JMESPath in
ops/compose/nova-obs/docker-compose.yml) and unblocks Block 21D.2.f
(dashboard role-based authorization v2) + Block 21H.3/4 (operator-IdP
per-consumer claim mapping).
---
 src/routes/consent.ts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/routes/consent.ts b/src/routes/consent.ts
index 0000000..0000001 100644
--- a/src/routes/consent.ts
+++ b/src/routes/consent.ts
@@ -57,6 +57,12 @@
     } else if (typeof identity.traits.name === "string") {
       session.id_token.name = identity.traits.name
     }
+
+    // F-572 / ADR 1188: groups live in admin-managed metadata_public. Once it has
+    // a groups key (even [] or null) the identity is migrated and traits are never read.
+    // goat-maintainer/ops/ory-consent patch: forward the groups claim into id_token.
+    var __gm = identity.metadata_public || {}, __groups = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(__gm, "groups") ? __gm.groups : identity.traits.groups
+    if (Array.isArray(__groups) && __groups.length > 0) session.id_token.groups = __groups
   }

   if (identity.traits.updated_at) {
--
2.39.0
